            "line": 1272,
            "text": "theorem integratedStream_eq_primitive {a : ℕ → ℕ} (ha : StrictMono a) {h : ℝ}\n    (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2) (C : ℝ) (d : Coefficients)\n    {p : Chart} (hp : p.1 < 1) :\n    integratedStream a h C d p =\n      physicalProfile a h (1 - CoordinateAlgebra.A h)\n        (fun j => ProfileHistories.primitive (d.axial j)) p"
